Comment: Panero is an independent fork of Krusader. It is not affiliated with
 or endorsed by KDE or the Krusader maintainers.
 .
 Panero is based on Krusader 2.8.1 (https://krusader.org/,
 https://invent.kde.org/utilities/krusader) and, like Krusader, is
 distributed under the GNU General Public License version 2 or (at your
 option) any later version. This file was derived from the SPDX headers in
 the source tree, the REUSE metadata in .reuse/dep5 (checked with
 "reuse lint") and "licensecheck -r". A readable overview is installed as
 /usr/share/doc/panero/LICENSING.md(.gz); the license texts used by the
 source tree are installed in /usr/share/doc/panero/LICENSES/.
 .
 All runtime libraries (Qt 5, KDE Frameworks 5, glibc, zlib, libacl, ...) come
 from separate Ubuntu packages and are not included in this package.

