License: GPL-2+
Comment: libisofs 0.2, used by the iso:/ KIO worker (kio_iso.so). The SPDX
 headers declare GPL-2.0-or-later. When imported in 2004 (upstream commit
 dd9d71dd2) iso_fs.h and rock.h only said "From the linux kernel",
 el_torito.h "borrowed from the bsd386 isofs", and bswap.h "From the mplayer
 project" (with a few lines from glibc's bits/byteswap.h, LGPL-2.1+). The
 Linux kernel is distributed under GPL-2.0 only; if those headers are
 regarded as derived from it, kio_iso.so can only be redistributed under
 GPL version 2, which the GPL-2+ terms of the rest of Panero permit.

